## 1. What this covers

"Covered Work" means the 4weird platform and everything we operate or
publish through it, including: the website and apps at 4weird.com /
4weird.games, VibeCodeWorker (robot game-tester, APIs, harnesses, docs),
games and game bundles in this repo, art, music, text, video, clan/bot/
agent/desktop/team/blender/fal/Meshy surfaces, and related software,
APIs, docs, and configs.

Third-party engines, models, and provider services (e.g. RunPod,
Shopify, OpenAI, fal.ai) remain under their own terms. Our license does
not grant you any rights in them.

